'''Junior God Brynhildr''' (神徒ブリュンヒルデ, ''Shinto Buryunhirude'') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Yurudrasil Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Junior God Brynhildr
|appearance = [[Yurudrasil Collaboration Event]]
|image = E 201.png
|money drop = 660円 - 2,607円
}}

==Enemy==
An enemy with pitiful damage but high health. Nothing too special for a peon.

==Strategy==
In the [[The End is Coming?! Nyagnarok!|final stage]] she appears in she becomes much more threatening being able to deal 8,000 damage and having 300,000 health. Remember that she is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating Enemy]] so any units that are Anti-Floating are able to deal with her in no time.

